## 7. AI-ASSISTED HAZARD SCAN

**7.1** The AI work area scan feature transmits images to Anthropic
PBC (USA) for processing under Anthropic's privacy policy. Images
are not stored by Integrity Insider and are deleted from the device
immediately after processing.

**7.2** The AI-assisted scan output is a visual observation only.
It does not:

(a) Constitute a risk assessment;

(b) Assign a risk rating or risk score;

(c) Represent the view of Integrity Insider on the safety of
    any work area;

(d) Constitute evidence in any legal, regulatory, insurance,
    workers' compensation or disciplinary proceeding.

**7.3** Users must not rely on the AI scan output as the basis
for any safety decision. The output is provided solely to assist
the User's own independent hazard identification process.

**7.4** Integrity Insider makes no warranty as to the accuracy,
completeness or currency of any AI-generated output.

